OL,3,GNEWSAKneecap visit Garvaghy Road to
OL,4,Ashow support for residents
OL,5,
OL,6,FIrish language rap group Kneecap have
OL,7,Fvisited the Garvaghy Road to show
OL,8,Fsupport for residents as a renewed
OL,9,Fdispute over an Orange Order parade
OL,10,Fcontinues.
OL,12,FHundreds gathered on the road in
OL,13,FPortadown on Sunday evening as the
OL,14,Fgroup met residents.
OL,16,FTheir visit came on the eve of an
OL,17,Fexpected Court of Appeal hearing over a
OL,18,Fdecision allowing the Portadown
OL,19,FDistrict Orange Lodge to march along
OL,20,Fthe road, something local residents
OL,21,Fstrongly oppose.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,417,410,260,120,0,100
