OL,3,GNEWSAKneecap visit Garvaghy Road to
OL,4,Ashow support for residents
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Portadown District maintains that
OL,7,Fit has a lawful determination allowing
OL,8,Fthe parade to proceed, and has
OL,9,Frepeatedly attempted to begin the march
OL,10,Fover the past week, including on Sunday
OL,11,Fmorning.
